  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An massless equilateral triangle EFG of side &#39;a&#39; (As shown in figure) has three particles of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> situated at its vertices. The moment of inertia of the system about the line EX perpendicular to EG in the plane of EFG is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>20</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>ma</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> is an integer. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> is ___________ .</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/73ba7dbe-ddce-4767-9ea1-9b2a1b2db46d-image.png\" style=\"width: 91px; height: 104px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ma</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>ma</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>ma</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p>",
